he history  it belongs to.\r\nIn addition it doesn't seem hard to convey that when the callable is attached to an object, it will be used to deduce the history, so i think it is worth the extra effort.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5226807334/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]